OL,3,AUS approves SpaceX plan to send a
OL,4,Amillion data satellites to space
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts approval comes as communities
OL,7,Facross the US have pushed back against
OL,8,Fthe expansion of data centres on the
OL,9,Fground.
